{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Third plan-review remediation for blocking E6/F1 finding: marked the four editorial criteria `[non-codebase]` and bound their manual proof to a ticket comment containing reviewer identity, UTC timestamp, and the completed row-by-row result. Also made the missing/empty-metadata failure-injection test explicit and clarified that `public_description` is the authoritative external prose while existing comments remain internal notes. Scope remains configuration-documentation generation only; runtime behavior is unchanged."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787421890547400001,"uuid":"8f8b4f34-2dee-4229-98d2-9cf56e49db26"}